	(text "INCOMPLETE / DO NOT INTEGRATE: power-drive and current path drafted only.\\nOPEN: VDRV12 regulator+bootstrap; U9001 VCCUV/OVLO/TG wiring; \\nFAN_CMD AND PWM gate; OCP comparator threshold/pull-up + latch; TVS/input protection; footprints; validation.\\nNo hardware/fire test. 50V transient ceiling is an assumption, not implemented."
	(at 60 185 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "c4f04438-9010-4845-9b14-56b8eee2c4a0")
)
	(text "QUALIFIED LOGIC: INP = ((FAN_CMD AND PWM_SPEED_CMD) OR FAN_EMERG_3V3) AND OCP_OK. R9002=100k pulls INP low. Loss of +3V3 drives gates Hi-Z; R9002 forces LTC7001 INP=LOW even with VIN/VDRV alive. OCP_OK is LMV331 open collector: overcurrent pulls LOW and therefore turns OFF both PWM and emergency command."
	(at 25.4 25.4 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "7a0cedfe-3bea-4986-9b14-cd6ceedee7a6")
)
	(text "CURRENT INTERFACE: design continuous limit 15 A; comparator trip/release corridor 19.11…22.42 A for +3V3=3.135…3.465 V and 1% resistors. This is hardware turn-off, not a current regulator. External branch fuse/wiring/connector must be selected for the 15 A continuous interface; motor L/I/start profile remains a commissioning measurement."
	(at 25.4 38.1 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "9d37620e-4da2-486a-9884-2b2cd289474b")
)
	(text "PWM RELEASE GATE: firmware 1…78125 Hz / 1…1000 permille is NOT qualified by this schematic. Qg,max=210nC makes gate-charge demand 4.20mA @20kHz and 16.406mA @78125Hz; exact driver output-current, bootstrap recharge impedance, switching loss and thermal limits require bench capture before any dynamic-PWM maximum is released. Static OFF/ON is the only pre-bench permitted state."
	(at 25.4 50.8 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "6890d60a-dc78-4dfc-92ce-a94adf6f074d")
)
	(text "POWER/TRANSIENT: LM317HV IN-OUT 60V abs-max with 30% margin requires VIN clamp <=46.154V during an output short. No input TVS is fitted: transient qualification remains OPEN. D9002 MBR1100G (100V) is A=VDRV12V/K=BST and has 2.17x voltage margin to that conservative clamp ceiling. D9001 STPS30H100CW: both anodes=MOTOR_POS, common cathode=GND."
	(at 25.4 63.5 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "7c1f2b5d-f7da-456d-8417-4571c933d4b6")
)
	(text "D9001 corrected: A1(1)+A2(3)=GND; K/tab(2)=MOTOR_POS.\nEarlier export/qualification stating reversed polarity is INVALID.\nDRAFT: PWM, thermal/SOA and input protection NOT qualified."
	(at 15 40 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
